{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>宏福苑大火造成 168 人死亡，政府委任的獨立委員會上周向特首李家超提交報告，報告今日將會正式發布。李家超和相關官員今日下午 2 時 45 分在政府總部召開記者會，而傳媒可以在 1 時 45 分開始預覽報告。《法庭線》將會持續關注特首記者會的最新進展。</p>\n<p></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:23.013271+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"The Witness","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:31:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.751267+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.751267+00:00","content_hash":"f40ca68d6edce1fa22e46f1c375c7878b916ddf7426b5ed97cd693b2f22be208","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}